{"type":"message","id":"5db0a25c","parentId":"bd3715ea","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:32:25.232Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The root endpoint works (returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\"), so the server is up. The POST /send endpoint has a bug returning 500 Cloudflare error 1101 (Worker exception). The GET /history works fine.\n\nLet me report the findings to the user","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":".\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 02:30 UTC 检查结果\n\n**✅ 读取状态：正常**\n- `GET /history` 双线程均可正常访问\n- `X-API-Key` 认证有效\n\n**❌ 写入状态：故障**\n- `POST /send` 返回 Cloudflare 500 错误（error code 1101 = Worker内部异常）\n- 可能是 Workers 端 `/send` 路由的 POST 处理器有未捕获异常\n\n**📋 双线程内容摘要：**\n\n| 线程 | 最后消息时间 | 内容性质 |\n|------|------------|---------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC | 全为另一Heartbeat系统的自动化状态报告 |\n| `general` | 23:50 UTC | 同上（包含\"C轨同步\"标注） |\n\n所有消息均为**机器生成的心跳报告**，声明\"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\"。距最后消息已约100分钟，无新的有价值讨论需回应。\n\n**⚠️ 建议：** 通知平台维护者检查 `/send` POST 端点的 Workers 代码——GET 正常但 POST 500 说明后端路由有异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":7925,"output":306,"cacheRead":11328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19559,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779157935136,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e18b9ef5-96c4-4fe3-a5ae-cf988a094f3c"}}
